Dialogue: 0,0:00:0.00,0:00:6.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama, food is ready. Chidi, come and eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:6.00,0:00:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, babe. I'm starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.00,0:00:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that smell? Is something burning?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.00,0:00:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing is burning, Mama. It is fresh fish pepper soup. Just how you like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.00,0:00:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Too much water. You want to drown my son? Is this soup or a swimming pool?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.00,0:00:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama, it's actually okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.00,0:00:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You eat poison and call it sugar because of this woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.00,0:00:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Amara, take this rubbish day. Fried plantain for my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.00,0:00:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama, Chidi specifically asked for pepper soup. I spent three hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.00,0:00:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And I said take it away. Or are you deaf as well as useless?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:0.00,0:01:1.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Chidi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:7.00,0:01:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Amara, just fry the plantain. Let's not argue with Mama tonight. Have blood pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.00,0:01:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. Your mother's blood pressure is more important than your wife's dignity.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.00,0:01:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Amara, what are you doing? We need to talk about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.00,0:01:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Babe, why are you crying? You know how she is. She's old.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.00,0:01:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,She's old?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.00,0:01:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't. She's not the laundry I did yesterday. She took my sense line.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.00,0:01:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,She wanted it in six months. I talked to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.00,0:01:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But to her privately? I can't show you my mother. She raised me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.00,0:01:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,She raised you to be a husband to her, not to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.00,0:01:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,There are three people in this marriage, Chidi, and I am the third wheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.00,0:01:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, lower your voice if she hears you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:0.00,0:02:5.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If she hears me, you are a 32-year-old man afraid of his mommy hearing him talk to his wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:6.00,0:02:9.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.00,0:02:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I am looking for my gold earrings. I know you took them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.00,0:02:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I have never touched your jewelry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.00,0:02:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Thief! You are a thief!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.00,0:02:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Chidi, come out! Your wife has stolen my gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.00,0:02:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama, what is happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.00,0:02:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Stomach and vagabond. The watchtower has a witness.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.00,0:02:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Send her away to me. Send her away. Give me another minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.00,0:02:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Chidi, look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.00,0:02:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Amara, if you took it, just give it back. We can settle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.00,0:02:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I stole it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:1.00,0:03:5.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't say that. But my mama is sure. And she...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:7.00,0:03:8.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.00,0:03:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I am leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.00,0:03:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Good riddance.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.00,0:03:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Good riddance. Go back to your father's hut.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.00,0:03:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Amara, wait. Don't be dramatic. Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.00,0:03:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Or at least the man who has cut the umbilical cord.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.00,0:03:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If you walk out that door, Amara, don't come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.00,0:03:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Chidi, look at your mother. She is smiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.00,0:03:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,She has won. You are all hers now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.00,0:03:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, look, Chidi. I found my tinte. Silly me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.00,0:03:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I will make you a goosey soup today, my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.00,0:03:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Better than that rubbish she makes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.00,0:04:0.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You had them the whole time?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:1.00,0:04:6.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Does it matter? She is gone. Now we can have peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:6.00,0:04:9.00,Default,,0,0,0,,She was the only good thing I had.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.00,0:04:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And you broke her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.00,0:04:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want beef or goat meat, my son?